taking books and tear out every page on which a four-letter-word
appears.  Does *that* make better persons?

> have been censoring for me !].

That would have had no impact, I assume. You can ask the average
juvenile if (s)he can obtain pornographic material (no matter in which
way) and the answer will be 90% yes regardless of the kind of
